jewelry.com/articles/the-complete-guide-to-engagement-ring-styles)\n- **Pav\u00e9 or Side Stone:** Small diamonds are set along the band to add extra shimmer from every angle.[[1]](https://www.tiffany.com/engagement/diamond-education/ring-settings-styles.html)[[2]](https://www.sarahojewelry.com/articles/the-complete-guide-to-engagement-ring-styles)\n\nYou can explore full visual breakdowns and design inspirations on the [Brilliant Earth Engagement Ring Styles Guide](https://www.brilliantearth.com/guides/engagement-ring-styles/) or read the [Sarah O. Complete Guide to Engagement Ring Styles](https://www.sarahojewelry.com/articles/the-complete-guide-to-engagement-ring-styles).[[1]](https://www.sarahojewelry.com/articles/the-complete-guide-to-engagement-ring-styles)[[2]](https://www.brilliantearth.com/guides/engagement-ring-styles/)To help narrow down the best style for you, let me know:\n\n- What is your **budget range**?\n- Do you prefer **yellow gold, white gold, or platinum**?\n- What **center stone shape** (like round, oval, or cushion) do you like best?", "items": [{"type": "ai_overview_element", "position": "left", "title": null, "text": "Engagement ring styles range from classic solitaire designs to sparkling halo and multi-stone settings.", "markdown": "![Engagement ring styles chart has me lost : r/WeddingRingAdvice](https://api.dataforseo.com/cdn/i/09290840-2330-0066-0000-1d95d5c8fa66:2)\nEngagement ring styles range from `classic solitaire designs to sparkling halo and multi-stone settings`.[[1]](https://www.brilliantearth.com/guides/engagement-ring-styles/)[[2]](https://www.jared.com/top-engagement-ring-trends)", "links": null, "images": [{"type": "images_element", "alt": "Engagement ring styles chart has me lost : r/WeddingRingAdvice", "url": null, "image_url": "https://api.dataforseo.com/cdn/i/09290840-2330-0066-0000-1d95d5c8fa66:3"}], "references": [{"type": "ai_overview_reference", "position": "left", "source": "Brilliant Earth", "domain": "www.brillia